    "instructions": "Use this public, read-only server to search ebooks and audiobooks, read one book with its bookshop links and fresh store offers, and browse the bookshop directory. Cite the returned /es page URL. Repeat only returned prices, list prices, discounts and valid_until exactly; never compute a discount yourself, estimate a missing price, compare or rank stores, or quote a price after its valid_until. Give checkout_url to the user but never fetch it, because opening it can create a cart at the independent bookshop. EbooksDepository does not process orders or payments. Documentation is at https://ebooksdepository.com/guide.md.",
